<p class="l-kicker">Weekly metrics &middot; Payments</p>
<h1>Payments, week 43</h1>
<p class="l-lede">Checkout recovered after the tax fix shipped on Tuesday. Abandonment is back to where it was in
September.</p>
<p class="l-meta">Checkout events, 19 to 25 October 2026 &middot; canopy worker, for Sam Okafor, 26 October</p>
<div class="l-kpis">
<div class="l-kpi"><span>p95 checkout</span><b>430&nbsp;ms</b>
<em class="l-good">&minus;64%, faster than week 42</em></div>
<div class="l-kpi"><span>Abandoned at payment</span><b>8.3%</b><em class="l-good">&minus;2.1 points</em></div>
<div class="l-kpi"><span>Authorizations</span><b>212,400</b><em>Level with week 42</em></div>
</div>
<figure>
<figcaption>p95 checkout by day, in milliseconds</figcaption>
<svg class="l-chart" viewBox="0 0 440 200" role="img"
    aria-label="p95 checkout fell from 1,180 ms on Monday to 430 ms by Sunday, under the 450 ms target from Thursday">
<line x1="50" y1="170" x2="430" y2="170" stroke="var(--l-rule)"/>
<line x1="50" y1="110" x2="430" y2="110" stroke="var(--l-muted)" stroke-dasharray="4 4"/>
<text x="44" y="174" text-anchor="end">0</text>
<text x="44" y="114" text-anchor="end">450</text>
<text x="44" y="14" text-anchor="end">1,200</text>
<polyline fill="none" stroke="var(--l-c1)" stroke-width="3"
    points="60,13 120,18 180,74 240,103 300,108 360,111 420,113"/>
<text x="60" y="192">Mon</text>
<text x="180" y="192" text-anchor="middle">Wed</text>
<text x="300" y="192" text-anchor="middle">Fri</text>
<text x="420" y="192" text-anchor="end">Sun</text>
</svg>
<ul class="l-legend">
<li class="l-c1">p95 checkout</li>
<li>Target, 450&nbsp;ms</li>
</ul>
</figure>
<h2>What changed</h2>
<p>The tax quote now makes one call per cart. The fraud check moved back to submit time on Wednesday.</p>
<div class="l-callout l-risk">Declines at submit rose from 1.1% to 1.4%, as expected once the check runs there
again.</div>
